<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman,serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">Emerging growth company&#160;<span style="font-family: Segoe UI Symbol,sans-serif"><span id="xdx_902_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20240521__20240521_znHvfD9CXPHh"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-05-21" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman,serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

